  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>About our brand and products:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Brother &amp; Sisters creates meaningful personalized jewelry that helps people carry their loved ones close to their heart. Our signature pieces feature photo projection technology — tiny hidden images inside pendants that reveal precious memories when held to light. From custom engraved necklaces to memorial keepsakes, every piece tells a story of love, connection, and cherished moments.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>What makes us different:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We specialize in emotional, heartfelt jewelry with real personalization — not generic “custom” pieces. Our photo projection technology is unique, allowing customers to hide a treasured photo inside an elegant pendant. We serve customers celebrating love across distances, honoring lost loved ones, or gifting something truly one-of-a-kind. With over 8 years in business and thousands of happy customers across Europe and beyond, quality and customer care are at our core.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>How affiliates can earn:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Earn generous commissions on every sale you refer. Our high-converting product pages and emotionally resonant marketing materials make it easy to drive sales. With an average order value of €50+ and strong repeat customer rates, your earnings add up quickly.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>How to promote us:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Share authentic stories — our jewelry resonates most when paired with real emotion. Gift guides, “meaningful gift ideas” content, long-distance relationship advice, memorial/remembrance content, and Mother’s Day or Valentine’s campaigns perform exceptionally well. We provide high-quality images and creatives to support your promotions.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Other information:</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We ship internationally with reliable delivery. Our customer service team is responsive and dedicated to ensuring satisfaction. Perfect for content creators in lifestyle, relationships, family, and gift niches.</span></p></div></div>",
